# Google Maps Platform browser API key for /directions (Maps JavaScript,
# Places API (New), and Routes API enabled in the project).
# Restrict this key to website HTTP referrers (https://gloryconf.web.app/*
# and http://localhost:5173/*) and to these three APIs.
# Vite embeds VITE_ values in client-side JavaScript: NOT a private secret.
# Add the real key only in the untracked .env.local file.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
